Third-party components

Runtime dependencies are resolved by Maven and keep their own licences.

The example invoices in the module phlox-testfiles (directory
src/main/resources/external/en16931) are used for testing only. They originate
from publicly available EN 16931 example sets (among them the examples of CEN/TC
434, of Peppol and of the XRechnung releases, partly taken over from the project
en16931-cii2ubl). The origin of each set is described in the README.md of its
directory. The files under synthetic/ were generated for phlox with
phlox-testfiles/tools/generate-synthetic.py.

The file phlox-testfiles/src/main/resources/logo/phoss.png is the logo of the
phoss projects of Philip Helger. It serves as the sample logo of the tests.
